{"title":"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/7/9d7c7f837493a45786484b1f066f9b096987fc3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = 24^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/0/960ff174b4de8b1418613a77bb59e1c9ce1d61f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD = 20^\\circ$\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" />. What is the smallest possible degree measure for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10a2dee30b7c2a0575d69397aea2b1c6b17c985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/7/bd7adafc33e8c6fc0c2525170ee1ae9342fbc466.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93e72b9d2c86f197276a931aba77c472d0511c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" /> share ray <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />. In order to minimize the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/0/b10a2dee30b7c2a0575d69397aea2b1c6b17c985.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBD$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> should be located between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/f/7ff10961872ed2b214cb7cc6b60a0bd3c5c04418.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = \\angle ABD + \\angle CBD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"215\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4cc5bcccd15e4548207fb88e45cbcb0e187b4d60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CBD = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"13\" />. The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723b429af793af50b01f31ed8467bba78553c55c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ehawVnD0wc4\">https://youtu.be/ehawVnD0wc4</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_